      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Adding \"critically low\" messaging could theoretically boost close rates by 15-25% on undecided carts, potentially recovering lost margins. however, applying this directly without proven historical data risks eroding long-term trust if customers feel misled. A safer approach is A/B testing the headline and writers to identify the specific messaging mix that converts best on your platform without triggering cart abandonment.",
      "source": "target",
